Herdr Workspace Plus
An independent workspace enhancement pack for Herdr, previously named Files Plus.

The file browser, read-only preview, Changes panel, and SVG assets are
derived from herdrdev/herdr-app:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Base commit: 816d2057d83f0cbd3705926c0231fb12963ae0fb
Original files: defaults/mods/files/ and defaults/mods/changes/
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes add Files and Changes context menus, per-file Git index actions,
local macOS filesystem actions, session history, account quota views,
installation tooling, tests, and documentation. Herdr Workspace Plus is not an
official Herdr release and is not endorsed by the upstream project.

Sessions Plus brand icons are copied from Herdr defaults/icons/ at the
same base commit and originate from LobeHub Icons:
https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons
